              "type": "text",
              "content": " , i.e., the angle of elevation of the top of the tower from the tip of the shadow is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "6 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and DB is the length of the shadow, when the angle of elevation is "
